<!-- 登录页使用自定义导航栏，避免原生导航栏在刷新时闪白条和出现首页按钮 -->
<view class="login-shell">
  <nav-bar title="" />
  <view class="login-body">
<view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" class="launch-splash">
  <view class="launch-top">
    <view class="brand-lockup">
      <view class="brand-mark">冰</view>
      <view class="brand-copy">
        <text class="brand-name">三冰 AI</text>
        <text class="brand-kicker">SANBING / COMMAND</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="top-meta">WECHAT NATIVE · CLOUD</text>
  </view>

  <view class="launch-main">
    <text class="eyebrow">{{loadingKicker}}</text>
    <text class="launch-title">{{loadingTitle}}</text>
    <text class="launch-copy">微信身份 · 云端同步</text>
    <view class="launch-line">
      <view class="launch-line__fill"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="launch-foot">
    <text>安全识别 · 云端档案</text>
    <text>V2.0 / 2026</text>
  </view>
</view>

<!-- 登录异常：才展示完整的编辑式登录封面 -->
<view wx:else class="login-page">
  <text class="login-index">00</text>

  <view class="login-top">
    <view class="brand-lockup">
      <view class="brand-mark">冰</view>
      <view class="brand-copy">
        <text class="brand-name">三冰 AI</text>
        <text class="brand-kicker">SANBING / COMMAND</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="top-meta">WECHAT NATIVE · CLOUD</text>
  </view>

  <view class="login-main">
    <view class="login-copy">
      <text class="eyebrow">PRIVATE COMMAND CENTER</text>
      <text class="display">为三国冰河时代玩家</text>
      <text class="display">而生的 <text class="display-accent">AI</text> 助手</text>
      <text class="lead">自动识别微信身份，恢复你的角色档案。无需注册，也无需重复登录。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="login-browse" hover-class="button-hover" bindtap="onBrowse">
      <text>先逛逛，不登录</text>
      <text class="login-browse-arrow">→</text>
    </view>

    <view class="auth-panel">
      <view class="auth-head">
        <text class="auth-kicker">AUTHENTICATION</text>
        <view class="auth-brand">
          <view class="auth-dot"></view>
          <text>WECHAT CLOUD</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="auth-timeline">
        <view class="auth-step">
          <text class="auth-num">01</text>
          <view class="auth-copy">
            <text class="auth-title">微信身份</text>
            <text class="auth-desc">由云开发安全识别</text>
          </view>
          <view class="auth-marker {{status === 'error' ? 'auth-marker--error' : (status === 'loading' ? 'auth-marker--active' : '')}}"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="auth-step">
          <text class="auth-num">02</text>
          <view class="auth-copy">
            <text class="auth-title">平台账号</text>
            <text class="auth-desc">自动建立或恢复档案</text>
          </view>
          <view class="auth-marker"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="auth-step">
          <text class="auth-num">03</text>
          <view class="auth-copy">
            <text class="auth-title">进入工作台</text>
            <text class="auth-desc">身份完成，加载个人中心</text>
          </view>
          <view class="auth-marker"></view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="auth-status">
        <block wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}">
          <view class="auth-loading">
            <view class="spinner"></view>
            <text>正在建立安全会话</text>
          </view>
          <text class="auth-note">首次登录将自动创建平台账号</text>
        </block>

        <block wx:elif="{{status === 'error'}}">
          <text class="auth-error">{{errorMessage}}</text>
          <button
            id="retryLoginButton"
            class="sb-primary"
            hover-class="button-hover"
            bindtap="onRetry"
          >重新登录</button>
          <text class="auth-note">请确认网络连接正常，或稍后再试</text>
        </block>

        <block wx:elif="{{status === 'welcome'}}">
          <button
            id="welcomeEnterButton"
            class="sb-primary"
            hover-class="button-hover"
            bindtap="onEnter"
          >微信登录</button>
          <text class="auth-note">点击后自动验证微信身份，无需注册</text>
        </block>

        <block wx:elif="{{status === 'signedOut'}}">
          <button
            id="enterAppButton"
            class="sb-primary"
            hover-class="button-hover"
            bindtap="onEnter"
          >重新验证并进入</button>
          <text class="auth-note">微信身份不会解除，点击后重新读取云端档案</text>
        </block>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="login-footer">
    <view class="footer-line"></view>
    <view class="footer-row">
      <text>安全识别 · 云端档案</text>
      <text class="footer-version">V2.0 / 2026</text>
    </view>
    <text class="privacy-note">微信头像昵称将在登录后由你主动确认，也可以稍后完善</text>
  </view>
</view>
  </view>
</view>
